[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Perceptron\n    ↓\nLinear Combination\n    ↓\nActivation Function\n    ↓\n단일 선형 모델의 한계\n    ↓\nHidden Layer를 추가한 MLP\n    ↓\nBackpropagation\n    ↓\nWeight / Bias Update\n    ↓\nTraining",
    "sha256": "f6b7622c3884f0f6894342538d07e1068ea1ab65cc8746a1bb8d2c2e60f3e9a6"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "z < 0\n→ OFF\n→ 0\n\nz ≥ 0\n→ ON\n→ 1",
    "sha256": "51aea14e7df34ebed6a7740c881eeea0506163e6f9a9dc57b89414b6486d0e33"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Input\n  ↓\nWeight × Input\n  ↓\nSummation + Bias\n  ↓\nStep Function\n  ↓\nOutput",
    "sha256": "be78edb169339fc28f33349b8ec6f0ae639da8a769f3616a4c85235182409a6d"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Single Perceptron\n        ↓\nLinear Decision Boundary\n        ↓\nNon-linear Problem 해결 불가",
    "sha256": "01dddd2cbc50624d830c5b4d7aacd17ad1cabd2397e4e5f967cdd02d4e9e62a8"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Input Layer\n     ↓\nHidden Layer\n     ↓\nOutput Layer",
    "sha256": "3269d38c2f67f5c22783917226f688fec5829b374eb0e243fd837ba96c93c1b3"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Input\n  ↓\nHidden Layer 1\n  ↓\nHidden Layer 2\n  ↓\n...\n  ↓\nOutput",
    "sha256": "a6cae36c59fee21f800c4c895f08f2bf1a199b49053e7461693058b35b31dd6b"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "language": "python",
    "text": "self.linear1 = nn.Linear(1, 10)\nself.relu = nn.ReLU()\nself.linear2 = nn.Linear(10, 1)",
    "sha256": "5628ad44a236f51a61a1fc9d4b4597566c27fcb85df9277d0ac31fe0d6c15951"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "language": "python",
    "text": "x = self.linear1(x)\nx = self.relu(x)\nx = self.linear2(x)",
    "sha256": "8dc8d0b52e6776d03789ae71aac67af65802380d4f2e1c2016089bd88b7b0bd0"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Input\n  ↓\nLinear Layer\n  ↓\nReLU\n  ↓\nLinear Layer\n  ↓\nOutput",
    "sha256": "60e898fc9409312bf8767152e520e54ec00aa7168d87bb283d778ebf3ce5ffc3"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Linear Transformation\n        ↓\nNon-linear Activation\n        ↓\nLinear Transformation\n        ↓\nNon-linear Activation",
    "sha256": "71f539b13e2825765c00d37137a80ca24ee392b180c6a65c646529e6e46400fd"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "입력 < 0\n→ 0\n\n입력 ≥ 0\n→ 1",
    "sha256": "e9ecbe190c5901d78fec2b6c0022ac6600b3d51acb9649e8dcab8a00e0852aa8"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "0\n      ↗\n    ↗\n  ↗\n       1",
    "sha256": "5bf41fca27024002daba6684a05f5c45f22a7dcc10d0571e62c85f049ac2ef38"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "입력 < 0\n→ 0\n\n입력 > 0\n→ 입력 그대로",
    "sha256": "57ffab13f3953972ca5eb3caa836213c92e710f0ea22b3b9a80fcb4e84efe3c3"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Step Function\n- Perceptron에서 사용\n- Gradient 기반 Deep Network Training에 부적합\n\n        ↓\n\nSigmoid\n- 부드럽고 미분 가능\n- Backpropagation 가능\n- Saturation 영역에서 Gradient가 매우 작아짐\n\n        ↓\n\nReLU\n- 계산이 단순함\n- 양수 영역 Gradient = 1\n- Vanishing Gradient 문제 완화",
    "sha256": "40a182d0cf6a65a3eb4d61714ef43ba649d5ba20425f708e6e6045b6cdef81c5"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Input\n  ↓\nForward Propagation\n  ↓\nPrediction\n  ↓\nLoss Calculation\n  ↓\nBackpropagation\n  ↓\nOptimizer\n  ↓\nParameter Update\n  ↓\nRepeat",
    "sha256": "c4a49b78c39b50193259293d80dd3c44160f902ae323321600c66c29a7c96856"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Input\n↓\nLinear\n↓\nReLU\n↓\nLinear\n↓\nOutput",
    "sha256": "245cf75fc54cf691857e47bc03b39265ed0c33bff038ba5138255783064f4aa7"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Forward\n\nInput\n  →\nHidden\n  →\nOutput\n  →\nLoss\n\n\nBackward\n\nLoss\n  →\nOutput Layer\n  →\nHidden Layer\n  →\nInput 방향",
    "sha256": "41086f6a627db46ce5f27ded18ca4dcac5be6261614b2d1b26377139fb1b215a"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "language": "python",
    "text": "loss.backward()",
    "sha256": "227fe80da08b6d02955034947b207abea315364b3d84ee7b1732f8e8c3b31d8d"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "language": "python",
    "text": "for parameter in model.parameters():\n    print(parameter.grad)",
    "sha256": "7acb0890472f71d0d7c40b7a0a613bffa0afcab73a6074e4be12ce5126af00a4"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "language": "python",
    "text": "loss.backward()",
    "sha256": "227fe80da08b6d02955034947b207abea315364b3d84ee7b1732f8e8c3b31d8d"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "language": "python",
    "text": "optimizer.zero_grad()\nloss.backward()\noptimizer.step()",
    "sha256": "18443360d1c66e6f1865e884c466fa5f79b86e54adf52603afac5f6c461b3407"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "optimizer.zero_grad()\n→ 이전 Gradient 초기화\n\nloss.backward()\n→ Backpropagation으로 Gradient 계산\n\noptimizer.step()\n→ 계산된 Gradient를 이용해 Parameter Update",
    "sha256": "58af76ce335dffc88eca3019f2e40135b9abfa74c0fd8c7eb462f7f361bda420"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "x = 1\nη = 0.1",
    "sha256": "5bc624c9be2a4ddc6f43749b74de6a8617775c3eab3c11eac2e73192fdc5db52"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "w = 0.5\nx = 1\n\nwx = 0.5\nŷ = 1\n\ny = 1",
    "sha256": "70b89a024dfce155e83e2f78b4951fed26158a8a04d1626a9c77935a0b7c3f0b"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "w = -0.3\nx = 1\n\nwx = -0.3\nŷ = 0\n\ny = 1",
    "sha256": "5e7064e1c1ed8acbee15b6f7842338ae0c2d6e64d13fd6bf15ae808bb46acce2"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "-0.3\n→\n-0.2",
    "sha256": "4e3a77c1b6233fcf5dea0532d70edbc589a920ab5f0ef32f73063535f8da20a3"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "w = 0.3\nx = 1\n\nwx = 0.3\nŷ = 1\n\ny = 0",
    "sha256": "064f7a8594d1dbece9b30851c4cb8e4529c962ee6d479c52af8a25e56478740b"
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "0.3\n→\n0.2",
    "sha256": "0658b7fdc773383b6b334b86b93edaf763f245f35cbce74ff5b5e58c8623d50c"
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "language": "text",
    "text": "Perceptron\n│\n├─ Input\n├─ Weight\n├─ Bias\n└─ Step Function\n        ↓\nSingle Linear Classifier\n        ↓\n복잡한 Non-linear 문제에 한계\n        ↓\nHidden Layer 추가\n        ↓\nMLP\n        ↓\nNon-linear Activation 필요\n        ↓\nSigmoid / ReLU\n        ↓\nForward Propagation\n        ↓\nPrediction\n        ↓\nLoss\n        ↓\nBackpropagation\n        ↓\nGradient\n        ↓\nOptimizer\n        ↓\nWeight / Bias Update\n        ↓\nTraining",
    "sha256": "2c59f2a8ca264eb7f1956f3d8fa8bcb426f6054a8484b853f898be01537dd55f"
  }
]
